- | `task_id` | string | 否 |  | 创建任务后返回的平台任务 ID。　例：`task_xxxxxxxxxxxx` |
- python3 scripts/client.py call nano_banana query --json '{"task_id": "task_xxxxxxxxxxxx"}'
